{"unit_id":"samuelrubiodev__dsh-hyper-tools#card-zh","repo":"samuelrubiodev/dsh-hyper-tools","commit":"08c09324a9959dfd95b22259a00b723dccfef6bd","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-hyper-tools 是一款 DSH LLM 中间件插件，为 Charm Hyper 等指定模型路由控制请求中的图片体积。它在 llm/stream 分发前检查对话历史，按可配置的图片字节数或图片数量限制，把较早的图片替换成 harness 标准占位文本，并保留较新的图片；若网关仍以请求体过大报错，可用更紧的预算重试一次。它也支持配置受保护的 provider 路由、替换步长和恢复比例，未匹配的路由或没有图片的请求会直接通过。适合长对话中累积图片、导致 Hyper 请求体超限的 DSH 用户；配置项均可选，默认保护 charm-hyper 与 hyper 路由。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:170-181","src/index.ts:203-253","src/guard.ts:72-90"]}
{"unit_id":"samuelrubiodev__dsh-hyper-tools#card-en","repo":"samuelrubiodev/dsh-hyper-tools","commit":"08c09324a9959dfd95b22259a00b723dccfef6bd","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-hyper-tools limits image payloads on selected DSH routes. Before dispatch, it replaces older images with placeholders to meet byte or count limits while keeping newer images. If the gateway rejects an oversized body, it can retry once with a tighter budget. All settings are optional.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:170-181","src/index.ts:203-253","src/guard.ts:72-90"]}
