{"unit_id":"samuelrubiodev__dsh-hyper-tools#feature-1","repo":"samuelrubiodev/dsh-hyper-tools","commit":"08c09324a9959dfd95b22259a00b723dccfef6bd","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-hyper-tools 的功能「图片预算投影」：在匹配的 LLM 路由发送前统计历史图片体积，并按字节或数量上限把较早图片替换为占位文本，保留较新的图片。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/guard.ts:49-90","src/index.ts:176-213"]}
{"unit_id":"samuelrubiodev__dsh-hyper-tools#feature-2","repo":"samuelrubiodev/dsh-hyper-tools","commit":"08c09324a9959dfd95b22259a00b723dccfef6bd","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-hyper-tools 的功能「请求体错误恢复」：当模型流以请求体超限错误结束时，可按更小图片预算重新投递一次；若无法进一步替换图片，则原样返回失败。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:215-253"]}
{"unit_id":"samuelrubiodev__dsh-hyper-tools#feature-3","repo":"samuelrubiodev/dsh-hyper-tools","commit":"08c09324a9959dfd95b22259a00b723dccfef6bd","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-hyper-tools 的功能「按 provider 路由筛选」：配置要保护的 provider 名称后，中间件只处理这些路由；其他路由、无图片请求以及插件自身重新投递的请求会直接通过。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:170-181"]}
{"unit_id":"samuelrubiodev__dsh-hyper-tools#feature-4","repo":"samuelrubiodev/dsh-hyper-tools","commit":"08c09324a9959dfd95b22259a00b723dccfef6bd","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-hyper-tools 的功能「图片替换策略配置」：可分别设置每次请求的图片字节预算、图片数量上限、恢复预算比例，以及溢出时的替换步长；插件会校验这些设置的边界。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:43-103","src/index.ts:117-167"]}
